{"id":"428193","name":"虾皮萝卜汤","author":"Linda厨房","authorId":"1907427","desc":"","cover":"images/428193/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所有材料准备好。","img":"images/428193/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"花肉切片，蒜苗切段备用。","img":"images/428193/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"萝卜洗干净去皮，切丝。","img":"images/428193/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虾皮下锅炒香，备用。","img":"images/428193/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"五花肉炒至两面金黄。","img":"images/428193/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入蒜苗炒香备用。","img":"images/428193/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里炒肉剩的油，炒萝卜丝。","img":"images/428193/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适当的清水，加盖焖煮。","img":"images/428193/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"待萝卜丝煮熟汤水变白时加入蒜苗，五花肉，虾皮一起煮片刻。加入适量的盐和鸡精即可。","img":"images/428193/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"虾皮萝卜汤。","img":"images/428193/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}